            "title": "Question: Intro 3",
            "id": 89955,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>ids_a</code> ve <code>ids_b</code> içinde depolanan listeler arasındaki fark nedir?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"ids = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;X12&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;M45&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Z10&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"ids_a = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;0&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + value \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" value \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ids]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(ids_a)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"ids_b = []\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" value \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ids:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  new_value = \" /><text value=\"&quot;1&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + value\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  ids_b.append(new_value)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(ids_b)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"['0X12', '0M45', '0Z10']\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"['1X12', '1M45', '1Z10']\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>ids_a</code> içindeki değerlerin önüne <code>\"0\"</code>, <code>ids_b</code> içindeki değerlerin önüne ise <code>\"1\"</code> eklenmiştir</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Hiçbir fark yok, birbirlerine eşdeğerler</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>ids_a</code>'nın aksine, <code>ids_b</code> bir liste depolar</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>ids_a</code> içindeki değerlerin önüne <code>\"0\"</code>, <code>ids_b</code> içindeki değerlerin önüne ise <code>\"1\"</code> eklenmiştir.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu kod çalışmadan önce <code>ids</code> ayrıca <code>\"Q7\"</code> içeriyor olsun. Hangi yeni öğeler ortaya çıkar?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"ids = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;X12&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;M45&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Z10&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"ids_a = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;0&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + value \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" value \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ids]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(ids_a)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"ids_b = []\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" value \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ids:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  new_value = \" /><text value=\"&quot;1&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + value\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  ids_b.append(new_value)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(ids_b)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"['0X12', '0M45', '0Z10']\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"['1X12', '1M45', '1Z10']\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">ids_a 0Q7, ids_b ise 1Q7 öğesini kazanır</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">ids_a 1Q7, ids_b ise 0Q7 öğesini kazanır</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Hem ids_a hem ids_b, ön ek olmadan Q7 öğesini kazanır</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">ids_a 0Q7, ids_b ise 1Q7 öğesini kazanır.</p></body></html>"
          },
