          {
            "title": "Question: For loop",
            "id": 89958,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu kodda yanlış olan ne?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"prices = [\" /><text value=\"13.5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"10.99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"reduced = [price - \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" prices]\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">for döngüsü <code>for price in prices</code> olmalı</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Bu kodda yanlış olan hiçbir şey yok</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>prices</code> değişkeni yok</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">for döngüsü <code>for price in prices</code> olmalı.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Hangi değişiklik <code>reduced</code> değişkeninin <code>prices</code> içindeki her öğe için bir değer içermesini sağlar?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"prices = [\" /><text value=\"13.5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"10.99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"reduced = [price - \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" prices]\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>[price - 1 for price in prices]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>[price - 1 for prices]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>[prices - 1 for price in prices]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>[price - 1 for price in prices]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Intro 3",
            "id": 89961,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>matcha_1</code> içindekiyle aynı listeyi oluşturması için <code>matcha_2</code> liste kavrayışının içine bir ifade kodla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"bundle = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;vanilla latte&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;vanilla scone&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"matcha_1 = []\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" item \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" bundle:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  update = item.replace(\" /><text value=\"&quot;vanilla&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;matcha&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  matcha_1.append(update)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"matcha_2 = [item.replace(\" /><text value=\"&quot;vanilla&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;matcha&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" item \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" bundle]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(matcha_1)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(matcha_2)\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"164\" endIndex=\"168\" /><option startIndex=\"168\" endIndex=\"176\" /><option startIndex=\"176\" endIndex=\"197\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(&quot;matcha&quot;, &quot;vanilla&quot;)\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['matcha latte', 'matcha scone']\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"['matcha latte', 'matcha scone']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>item</code>, ardından <code>.replace</code> ve son olarak <code>(\"vanilla\", \"matcha\")</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Her <code>vanilla</code> öğesini bir <code>matcha</code> öğesine dönüştürüp aynı listeyi oluşturmaları için iki biçimi de tamamla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"bundle = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;vanilla latte&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;vanilla scone&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"matcha_1 = []\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" item \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" bundle:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  update = item.replace(\" /><text value=\"&quot;vanilla&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;matcha&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  matcha_1.append(update)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"matcha_2 = [item.replace(\" /><text value=\"&quot;vanilla&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;matcha&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" item \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" bundle]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(matcha_1)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(matcha_2)\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"164\" endIndex=\"168\" /><option startIndex=\"168\" endIndex=\"176\" /><option startIndex=\"176\" endIndex=\"197\" /><option startIndex=\"142\" endIndex=\"148\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(&quot;matcha&quot;, &quot;vanilla&quot;)\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"bundle\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['matcha latte', 'matcha scone']\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"['matcha latte', 'matcha scone']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>update</code>, ardından <code>item</code>, <code>.replace</code> ve son olarak <code>(\"vanilla\", \"matcha\")</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Copy",
            "id": 89973,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>passwords</code> listesinin bir kopyasını oluşturacak şekilde bir ifade kodla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"passwords = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;12345&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;XhJ%%M&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"copy = [password \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" password \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" passwords]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(copy)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"49\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['12345', 'XhJ%%M']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>password</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
