          {
            "title": "Question: Return statement",
            "id": 90011,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu fonksiyonlardan hangilerini liste üreteci içinde kullanabiliriz?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"multiply\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(num_1, num_2)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  num_1 * num_2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"divide\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(number, divisor)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" number/divisor\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"add\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(num_1, num_2)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(num_1 + num_2)\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Yalnızca <code>divide(number, divisor)</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Üçü de</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Yalnızca <code>divide(number, divisor)</code> ve <code>add(num_1, num_2)</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Yalnızca <code>divide(number, divisor)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir fonksiyonun sonucunu liste öğesi olarak sağlamak için hesaplamasını döndürmesi gerekir.</p><p><code>multiply()</code> gövdesini <code>return num_1 * num_2</code> ile değiştirirsen hangi fonksiyonlar hesaplama döndürür?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"multiply\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(num_1, num_2)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  num_1 * num_2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"divide\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(number, divisor)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" number/divisor\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"add\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(num_1, num_2)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(num_1 + num_2)\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">multiply ve divide</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Yalnızca divide</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">multiply, divide ve add</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">multiply ve divide öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Function 2",
            "id": 90015,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>apply_taxes()</code> fonksiyonunun içinde önce katma değer vergisi <code>vat</code>'yi, ardından gümrük vergilerini hesapla ve <code>price</code> ile <code>vat</code> ve <code>duties</code>'nin toplamını döndür.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"prices = [\" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"450\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"27\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"apply_taxes\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(price)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  vat = \" /><text value=\"0.15\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" * price\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  duties = \" /><text value=\"0.20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" * price\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" price + vat + duties\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"tax_inclusive = [apply_taxes(price) \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" price \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" prices]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(tax_inclusive)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option startIndex=\"72\" endIndex=\"93\" /><option startIndex=\"96\" endIndex=\"102\" /><option startIndex=\"103\" endIndex=\"123\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"print\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[135.0, 607.5, 36.45]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>vat = 0.15 * price</code>, ardından <code>duties = 0.20 * price</code> ve sonra <code>return</code>, <code>price + vat + duties</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Önce fiyatın %15'i olarak <code>vat</code>, ardından %20'si olarak <code>duties</code> hesapla ve fiyatla birlikte ikisinin toplamını döndür.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"prices = [\" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"450\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"27\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"apply_taxes\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(price)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  vat = \" /><text value=\"0.15\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" * price\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  duties = \" /><text value=\"0.20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" * price\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" price + vat + duties\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"tax_inclusive = [apply_taxes(price) \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" price \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" prices]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(tax_inclusive)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option startIndex=\"72\" endIndex=\"93\" /><option startIndex=\"96\" endIndex=\"102\" /><option startIndex=\"103\" endIndex=\"123\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"vat = 0.15 + price\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"print\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[135.0, 607.5, 36.45]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>vat = 0.15 * price</code>, ardından <code>duties = 0.20 * price</code>, <code>return</code> ve son olarak <code>price + vat + duties</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Function as an expression",
            "id": 90013,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>savings</code> listesindeki her <code>amount</code> değerini değiştirmek için <code>exchange()</code> fonksiyonunu kullan.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"savings = [\" /><text value=\"120\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"300\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"exchange\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(dollars)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  euros = \" /><text value=\"0.8\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" * dollars\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  comission = \" /><text value=\"0.1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" * euros\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" euros - comission\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"euros = [exchange(amount) \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" amount \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" savings]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(euros)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"136\" endIndex=\"152\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[86.4, 216.0, 36.0]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>exchange(amount)</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
