            "title": "Example: Multiple expressions",
            "id": 90010,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Parolanın <code>\"%\"</code> işareti içerip içermediğini kontrol et, ardından <code>\"&amp;\"</code> işaretini kontrol et ve son olarak <code>percent</code> veya <code>and_sign</code><code>True</code> ise <code>True</code> döndür.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"passwords = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;012345&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Xhf!%m0&amp;&amp;&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"is_valid\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(password)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  percent = password.count(\" /><text value=\"&quot;%&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") &gt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  and_sign = password.count(\" /><text value=\"&quot;&amp;&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") &gt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" percent \" /><text value=\"or\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" and_sign\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"valid = [is_valid(password) \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" password \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" passwords]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(valid)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"96\" /><option startIndex=\"110\" endIndex=\"133\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"percent and and_sign\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"143\" endIndex=\"162\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[False, True]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>password.count(\"%\") &gt; 0</code>, ardından <code>password.count(\"&amp;\") &gt; 0</code> ve son olarak <code>percent or and_sign</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Parolanın önce <code>\"%\"</code>, ardından <code>\"&amp;\"</code> içerip içermediğini kontrol et ve <strong>ikisinden biri</strong> varsa <code>True</code> döndür.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"passwords = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;012345&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Xhf!%m0&amp;&amp;&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"is_valid\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(password)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  percent = password.count(\" /><text value=\"&quot;%&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") &gt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  and_sign = password.count(\" /><text value=\"&quot;&amp;&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") &gt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" percent \" /><text value=\"or\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" and_sign\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"valid = [is_valid(password) \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" password \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" passwords]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(valid)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"96\" /><option startIndex=\"110\" endIndex=\"133\" /><option startIndex=\"143\" endIndex=\"162\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"password.count(&quot;%&quot;) == 0\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[False, True]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>password.count(\"%\") &gt; 0</code>, ardından <code>password.count(\"&amp;\") &gt; 0</code> ve son olarak <code>percent or and_sign</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
