            "title": "Example: Return statement",
            "id": 90009,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Fonksiyonun sonucunu, fonksiyonu liste üreteci içinde kullanmamıza olanak sağlayacak şekilde yazdır.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"meetings = [\" /><text value=\"9\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"11\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"16\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"reschedule\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(meeting_time)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  new_time = meeting_time + \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" new_time\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"rescheduled = [reschedule(meeting_time) \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" meeting_time \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" meetings]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(rescheduled)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"101\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[10, 12, 17]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>return new_time</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
