            "title": "Question: Filtering",
            "id": 90588,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu liste kavrayışının içindeki if ifadesi ne yapar?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"passwords = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;012345&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Xhf!%m0&amp;&amp;&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;password!!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"valid = [password \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" password \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" passwords \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" password.count(\" /><text value=\"&quot;!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") &gt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(valid)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"['Xhf!%m0&amp;&amp;', 'password!!']\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Bir parolanın yalnızca en az bir kez <code>\"!\"</code> içermesi durumunda kopyalanmasını sağlar</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Bir parolanın yalnızca <code>\"!\"</code> içermiyorsa kopyalanmasını sağlar</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Hiçbir şey yapmıyor, kod doğru değil</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Bir parolanın yalnızca en az bir kez <code>\"!\"</code> içermesi durumunda kopyalanmasını sağlar.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>if</code> koşulu, yeni listeye hangi öğelerin gireceğini filtreler.</p><p>Koşul <code>password.count(\"!\") == 1</code> olarak değiştirilirse hangi parola kopyalanır?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"passwords = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;012345&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Xhf!%m0&amp;&amp;&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;password!!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"valid = [password \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" password \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" passwords \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" password.count(\" /><text value=\"&quot;!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") &gt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(valid)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"['Xhf!%m0&amp;&amp;', 'password!!']\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Yalnızca <code>Xhf!%m0&amp;&amp;</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Yalnızca <code>password!!</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Hem <code>Xhf!%m0&amp;&amp;</code> hem <code>password!!</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Yalnızca <code>Xhf!%m0&amp;&amp;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
