            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Yalnızca <code>numbers</code> içindeki her <code>num</code> üzerinde yineleme yaparken <code>\"+44\"</code> değerini tam olarak bir kez içeriyorsa <code>num</code> değerini kopyala.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"numbers = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;+43 5753335&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;+44 0051239&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;+33 1218817&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"uk_numbers = [num \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" num \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" numbers \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" num.count(\" /><text value=\"&quot;+44&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") == \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(uk_numbers)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"74\" /><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"93\" /><option startIndex=\"94\" endIndex=\"96\" /><option startIndex=\"97\" endIndex=\"118\" /><option startIndex=\"118\" endIndex=\"119\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"num.count(&quot;+44&quot;) == 0\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['+44 0051239']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>[</code>, ardından <code>num</code> ve sonra <code>for num in numbers</code>, <code>if</code>, <code>num.count(\"+44\") == 1</code>, <code>]</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>numbers</code> içindeki her <code>num</code> değerini yalnızca <code>\"+44\"</code> ifadesini tam olarak bir kez içeriyorsa kopyala.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"numbers = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;+43 5753335&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;+44 0051239&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;+33 1218817&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"uk_numbers = [num \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" num \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" numbers \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" num.count(\" /><text value=\"&quot;+44&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") == \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(uk_numbers)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"74\" /><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"93\" /><option startIndex=\"94\" endIndex=\"96\" /><option startIndex=\"97\" endIndex=\"118\" /><option startIndex=\"118\" endIndex=\"119\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"num.count(&quot;+44&quot;) == 0\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"num.count(&quot;+43&quot;) == 1\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"numbers\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['+44 0051239']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>[</code>, ardından <code>num</code>, <code>for num in numbers</code>, <code>if</code>, <code>num.count(\"+44\") == 1</code> ve son olarak <code>]</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
